+#### `compaction/committed` — parallel
+
+A summary transaction and replacement have reached a persistence checkpoint. `durable` is false without a persistence listener. The summary iterator is closed and no assistant-message ACK is implied. Rejection preserves the committed checkpoint and stops later work.
+
+```ts cordis-catalog
+/**
+ * A summary transaction and replacement have reached a persistence
+ * checkpoint. `durable` is false without a persistence listener. The
+ * summary iterator is closed and no assistant-message ACK is implied.
+ * Rejection preserves the committed checkpoint and stops later work.
+ * @param payload - committed transaction and its exact summary event.
+ * @mode parallel
+ */
+'compaction/committed'(payload: { agent: Agent; result: CompactionResult; event: SessionEvent<'compaction/summary'>; signal?: AbortSignal; durable: boolean }): void | Promise<void>
+```
+
+Types: [Agent](core.md) · [SessionEvent](session.md)
