+
+#### `compaction/pressure-policy` — waterfall
+
+Apply explicit route-specific pressure, retention, and summary-budget overrides. The backend merges the returned fields over its validated default policy and validates the result. Undefined preserves existing configuration.
+
+```ts cordis-catalog
+/**
+ * Apply explicit route-specific pressure, retention, and summary-budget overrides.
+ * The backend merges the returned fields over its validated default policy
+ * and validates the result. Undefined preserves existing configuration.
+ * @mode waterfall
+ * @param payload - agent, actual priced route, default policy, and cancellation.
+ * @param next - delegate to another route policy or unchanged defaults.
+ * @returns optional overrides using the ordinary BasicCompaction policy fields.
+ */
