+### Provider commit and recovery policy
+
+`agent/replay-check` is a parallel veto before retry recovery and again immediately before redispatch. Every listener is awaited; rejection cannot be overridden by an `always` retry policy. Listeners must scope the veto to their own request and preserve unrelated providers' retry decisions.
